cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: CytoNorm Batch Normalization
abstract: Removes batch effects from arcsinh-transformed flow or mass cytometry FCS files with CytoNorm,
  learning per-metacluster quantile splines from reference samples or from each batch's pooled samples.
  Writes the normalised files with QC tables, spline plots and the model.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-cytonorm
license: Apache-2.0
